    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "State the axis in which\n$$x^2+y^3=2$$\nis reflected to give $x^2-y^3=2$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x$-axis.",
      "worked": "Replace $y$ by $-y$:\n$$x^2+(-y)^3=2.$$\nSince $(-y)^3=-y^3$, this gives $x^2-y^3=2$. The reflection is in the $x$-axis.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
